    {
      "id": "m1",
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "text": "What changes would you like to discuss?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m2",
      "speaker": "patient",
      "text": "I have felt down for six weeks. My doctor diagnosed hypothyroidism two weeks ago. I also have arthritis."
    },
    {
      "id": "m3",
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "text": "Had the low mood already begun before the thyroid diagnosis?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m4",
      "speaker": "patient",
      "text": "Yes. But I do not know when the thyroid problem itself began."
    },
    {
      "id": "m5",
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "text": "What symptoms or treatment changes have you noticed?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m6",
      "speaker": "patient",
      "text": "My joints hurt, so I cannot draw for long, but I still enjoy drawing. I started prednisone last week."
    },
    {
      "id": "m7",
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "text": "Has a clinician explained whether your mood is related to the thyroid condition?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m8",
      "speaker": "patient",
      "text": "The doctor said it might contribute, but that other explanations still need checking."
    },
    {
      "id": "m9",
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "text": "Have you had a similar low period earlier in life?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m10",
      "speaker": "patient",
      "text": "I felt low for a few months five years ago, but I do not remember what my thyroid tests were then."
    }
